{
  "Conversations": [
    {
      "ID": "Innkeeper_1",
      "Nodes": [
        {
          "ID": "Start",
          "Text": "Warm hearth, dry beds, and no questions about the mud on your boots. A room is ten drams — best sleep in the village, and the world keeps turning while you get it.",
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Heard anything interesting lately?",
              "Target": "GossipSeed",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "Reveal",
                  "Value": "Speaker:town_gossip:2"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "About that thing you mentioned — tell me the rest.",
              "Target": "GossipDeep",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfSpeakerKnows",
                  "Value": "town_gossip:2"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "[10 drams] Take a room and rest.",
              "Target": "Start",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "RestAtInn",
                  "Value": "10"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "[10 drams] Rest until the next time of day.",
              "Target": "Start",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "RestAtInnUntilNextBand",
                  "Value": "10"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "Where are the nearby settlements?",
              "Target": "RegionOverview"
            },
            {
              "Text": "Any reports from the wilderness?",
              "Target": "Rumors"
            },
            {
              "Text": "Just passing through.",
              "Target": "End"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "RegionOverview",
          "Text": "I can mark nearby settlements in your travel notes. These directions begin here; ask at the destination about local work.",
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Back.",
              "Target": "Start"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Rumors",
          "Text": "Travelers bring old reports from the wilderness, sometimes from far away. I can record what they heard; I cannot promise it is still there.",
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Good to know.",
              "Target": "Start"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "GossipSeed",
          "Text": "The innkeeper leans in. \"Between us? A merchant came through pale as bone, wouldn't say what he saw on the old road. Ask me again sometime — maybe I'll have pieced it together.\"",
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "(nod)",
              "Target": "__end__"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "GossipDeep",
          "Text": "\"Pieced it together, I have. The pale merchant saw LIGHTS in the ruins — moving in ranks, like a procession. No lantern walks in ranks. Whatever marches out there, it isn't looking for trade.\"",
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "(worth knowing)",
              "Target": "__end__"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
